From 9428563d3f9d42240a095b109974de93c22042aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wentywenty <2321901849@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 11:18:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] nusb: add Android usbfs enumeration and device open

Enable Linux usbfs enumeration on Android, expose the Linux DeviceInfo/BusInfo fields, and implement from_device_info() by opening /dev/bus/usb/BUS/ADDR. This is root-only; it does not use Android USB Host API permissions. Tested on Android 15 with Seeed CMSIS-DAP and WCH-Link.

Signed-off-by: wentywenty <2321901849@qq.com>
